# [BitTV fork] m3u-flussonic-tivimate.patch
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dual catchup support without conflicts:
#   1) flussonic (TiviMate path rewrite: index/video/mono/archive-{utc}-{duration})
#   2) Shift: ?utc=&lutc= (with or without m3u-catchup marker)
# - Panel Catchup/EPG: recover archive ts from m3u-catchup session token when BitTV
#   rewrites media URLs to date paths; keep archive HLS-cache sessions separate from live
#   and store archive origin URL on the access lease (playlist DB only has live URL).
# Apply BEFORE m3u-epg-url-tvg.patch.
# =============================================================================

